2026-07-27T09:49:34.7351584Z i /tmp/Rtmp6dYDIU/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:49:34.7352019Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:49:34.7352533Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:49:34.7353045Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:49:34.7353795Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:49:34.7354960Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:49:34.7356260Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
